Add a paragraph called title
Set the text of title to Focus Board

Add a section called board screen
Add a section called about screen

Add a paragraph called banner inside board screen
Set the text of banner to Live tasks from a real generated backend

Add a paragraph called celebration inside board screen
Set the text of celebration to Task added!

Add a text input called task title inside board screen
Add a paragraph called char count inside board screen
Set the text of char count to 0

Add a button called add task inside board screen
Set the text of add task to Add task

Add a paragraph called task error inside board screen

Add a bullet list called task list inside board screen

Add a checkbox called show tips inside board screen
Add a paragraph called tips inside board screen
Set the text of tips to Tip: press Add task after typing a title above.

Add a number input called batch count inside board screen
Set the value of batch count to 3
Add a button called add batch inside board screen
Set the text of add batch to Add sample tasks

Add a paragraph called focus roll inside board screen
Add a button called roll focus inside board screen
Set the text of roll focus to Suggest a focus number

Add a button called open about inside board screen
Set the text of open about to About this board

Add a paragraph called about text inside about screen
Set the text of about text to This bulleted list is fetched live from a real generated CRUD backend, not sample data.
Add a button called close about inside about screen
Set the text of close about to Back to board

When the page loads, hide about screen
When the page loads, hide celebration
When the page loads, disable add task
When the page loads, hide tips
When the page loads, list title of each record at /tasks into task list otherwise set the text of task error to Could not load tasks yet

When the task title changes, set the text of char count to the number of characters in the value of task title
When the task title changes, if the value of task title has at least 1 characters, enable add task otherwise disable add task

When the add task is clicked, create a record at /tasks with title set to the value of task title and then list title of each record at /tasks into task list otherwise set the text of task error to Could not add that task
When the add task is clicked, clear the value of task title
When the add task is clicked, set the text of char count to 0
When the add task is clicked, disable add task
When the add task is clicked, show celebration

When the show tips changes, toggle the visibility of tips

When the add batch is clicked, repeat the value of batch count times, create a record at /tasks with title set to the value of batch count
When the add batch is clicked, list title of each record at /tasks into task list otherwise set the text of task error to Could not refresh tasks

When the roll focus is clicked, set the text of focus roll to a random number from 1 to 45

When the open about is clicked, go to about screen
When the close about is clicked, go to board screen
